      "side": 1,
      "message": "I added a SkRGBA4f::pinAlpha() function. It performs the same regardless of whether or not it\u0027s premul or unpremul.  One of the usages of the direct SkTPin was intentionally operating on a SkPMColor4f and wanted to pin the alpha before converting back to an unpremul color.  I preserved that ability, vs. doing the alternative of \"unpremul().pinAlpha().premul()\" flow.\n\nI also updated the SkBlendModeColorFilter to pin alpha, so it\u0027s consistent with SkColorShader and SkPaint\u0027s handling of the constant colors.",
